<title>USA: Nortek sees benefits to continue in H2.</title>
<headline>Nortek sees benefits to continue in H2.</headline>
<dateline>PROVIDENCE, R.I. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nortek Inc said on Thursday that efforts to make operations more efficient were bringing about benefits that it expected to continue into the second half of 1997.</p>
<p>Citing attempts to bring higher quality to its products and to boost efficiency, Nortek chief executive Richard Bready said:</p>
<p>&quot;We expect these strategies to benefit us further as we move into the second half of a year in which economic conditions continue to be beneficial to our housing, building-products and related indoor-air-quality businesses.&quot;</p>
</text>
